<h1>Invoice <%= @invoice.invoice_number %></h1>

<p>Dear <%= @client.name %>,</p>

<p>Attached is your invoice from <%= @account.business_name %> for <%= number_to_currency(@invoice.total_amount, unit: "D") %>.</p>

<p>
  <strong>Invoice #:</strong> <%= @invoice.invoice_number %><br>
  <strong>Issue Date:</strong> <%= @invoice.issue_date&.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %><br>
  <strong>Due Date:</strong> <%= @invoice.due_date&.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
</p>

<p>Please see the attached PDF for full details. Payment can be made online.</p>

<p>Thank you for your business!</p>

<p><%= @account.business_name %></p>
